{'symbol': 'ADBE', 'date': '2019-10-26 20:30:00', 'title': "Adobe Says Late Last Week, Co Became Aware Of Vulnerability Related To Work On One Of Co's Prototype Environments", 'text': 'ADOBE SAYS LATE LAST WEEK, CO BECAME AWARE OF A VULNERABILITY RELATED TO WORK ON ONE OF CO\'S PROTOTYPE ENVIRONMENTS - BLOG.ADOBE SYSTEMS SAYS IT "PROMPTLY" SHUT DOWN MISCONFIGURED ENVIRONMENT, ADDRESSING VULNERABILITY RELATED TO WORK ON ONE OF ITS PROTOTYPE ENVIRONMENTS.ADOBE SAYS ISSUE WAS NOT CONNECTED TO, NOR DID IT AFFECT, THE OPERATION OF ANY ADOBE CORE PRODUCTS OR SERVICES- BLOG.ADOBE SAYS ENVIRONMENT AFFECTED BY VULNERABILITY CONTAINED CREATIVE CLOUD CUSTOMER E-MAIL ADDRESSES, BUT NOT ANY PASSWORDS OR FINANCIAL INFORMATION.'}
